\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 4. Technical Implementation & Troubleshooting\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prevalence Logic:
\f1\b0  Indicators are binary person-level flags (1/0) derived from incident matches in DS5.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Weights:
\f1\b0  All rates utilize PERWT (derived from WGTPERCY) to represent the total U.S. population.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Jittering:
\f1\b0  Continuous income distributions are simulated using \cf4 \cb5 \strokec4 runif()\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  on categorical codes to prevent "steppy" visual artifacts in the plot.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Path Integrity:
\f1\b0  The scripts use \cf4 \cb5 \strokec4 here::here()\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  for base paths. Ensure you pass only relative filenames to functions like \cf4 \cb5 \strokec4 create_multi_line_plot\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  to avoid nested directory errors.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

